    "type": "game",
    "name": "Popit Game",
    "steam_appid": 3698060,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698060/extras/1197e3dd0a2af62afa7b615541388107.avif?t=1750232953\" width=616 height=416 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calculate, maneuver, and outplay others using your deck. Pair it with tactically deployed Popits. And don't forget to count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How it works:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play card combos to match or beat each Block\u2019s score and climb upward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score enough points to lift the Block higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think. Count. Adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail \u2014 you fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>But you\u2019re not alone.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698060/extras/e8870839e737700cc3646c2771b45a63.poster.avif?t=1750232953\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698060/extras/e8870839e737700cc3646c2771b45a63.webm?t=1750232953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698060/extras/e8870839e737700cc3646c2771b45a63.mp4?t=1750232953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the Popits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Popits are unique user-generated cards that transform your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different Popits to trigger, abburate, mutate, distort, corrupt, or invert effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your score with Block Keepers</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block Managers distribute rewards</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acki Nacki is a combinatorial genius</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack your enemies with Malicious Block Producers</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your progress with the help of Block Producers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some appear once and vanish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others stay with you until your final breath in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698060/extras/0c85fb6225fd7c0560f2b9630226512c.poster.avif?t=1750232953\" width=616 height=516 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698060/extras/0c85fb6225fd7c0560f2b9630226512c.webm?t=1750232953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698060/extras/0c85fb6225fd7c0560f2b9630226512c.mp4?t=1750232953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Mechanic: Overdraft</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score enough on every block. But do not score too much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you need X and you score much more than X you pay an overdraft fee with your in-game money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go far over the target and the game will punish you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game isn\u2019t about scoring the most. It\u2019s about scoring above and as close to the target as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calculate carefully, using your wits \u2014 and your calculator \u2014 to claim your reward and not get wasted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698060/extras/c925b569e6120f6e5abe0cef6296c829.poster.avif?t=1750232953\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698060/extras/c925b569e6120f6e5abe0cef6296c829.webm?t=1750232953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698060/extras/c925b569e6120f6e5abe0cef6296c829.mp4?t=1750232953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer System:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other players can attack you \u2014 and you can attack them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a live, asynchronous multiplayer battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross paths with others \u2014 sometimes gently, sometimes head-on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The leaderboard breathes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your rank can rise, fall, or shift \u2014 even when you\u2019re offline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick your Popits in the Popit Shop.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Because Popit Game isn\u2019t just played \u2014 it\u2019s lived.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every session writes a new story.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698060/extras/1197e3dd0a2af62afa7b615541388107.avif?t=1750232953\" width=616 height=416 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calculate, maneuver, and outplay others using your deck. Pair it with tactically deployed Popits. And don't forget to count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How it works:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play card combos to match or beat each Block\u2019s score and climb upward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score enough points to lift the Block higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think. Count. Adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail \u2014 you fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>But you\u2019re not alone.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698060/extras/e8870839e737700cc3646c2771b45a63.poster.avif?t=1750232953\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698060/extras/e8870839e737700cc3646c2771b45a63.webm?t=1750232953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698060/extras/e8870839e737700cc3646c2771b45a63.mp4?t=1750232953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the Popits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Popits are unique user-generated cards that transform your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different Popits to trigger, abburate, mutate, distort, corrupt, or invert effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 